{"code": "const entry = String.raw`

## S1907 (2026-11-01): Serre large image on E'/F' -- no Lean port, precise first missing

**Result: MISSING (no fake).** ` + "tmp/sheaf/xif/paper/S1907SerreLargeImageActual.lean" + String.raw` (EXIT=0;
axioms propext/Classical.choice/Quot.sound only; no sorry, no new axiom; source
SHA256 686BA969B95E1C62C1C1D1C746E5F97453D8EB71FE1441E191AA7DE676F899DF;
olean 102248 bytes SHA256
E97337F97F44566AAEFB0F5355BF304C620D8308CAD10015E624E1D2210F1DBF) records the
uniform target ` + "`∀ l ≥ 5, SerreStyleLargeImageStatement S1720Curve l`" + String.raw`, proves
` + "`Uniform ↔ ∃ l0, Cofinite l0 ∧ Small l0`" + String.raw` and
` + "`(∃ l0, Cofinite l0) ↔ Set.Finite {l | ¬ target}`" + String.raw`, and defines the two
missing inputs: ` + "`S1907FirstMissing`" + String.raw` (only finitely many exceptional
primes; Serre open image / [GenEll] Thm 3.8) and ` + "`S1907FiniteVerification`" + String.raw`
(explicit mod-l image computation below the threshold, in particular l = 5).
No Lean port was located: Mathlib v4.32.2 has no Tate module / Galois
representation / Faltings height / open-image theorem; TauCeti has the local
Tate module and Serre's local lemma only; the tree's audit cards
` + "`IUT-I.elliptic-l-torsion-large-image`" + String.raw` and
` + "`Foundations.Geometry.elliptic-tate-uniformization`" + String.raw` are pending;
the ` + "`tmp/external`" + String.raw` IUT ports contain only source-hypothesis shapes.
[GenEll] Thm 3.8 does not cover l=5 (condition (b) excludes 2*3*5; condition
(a) is >= 23040 for a fixed curve), so the uniform statement needs the finite
check in addition to open image.
`;
await tools.write({file_path: "D:/lean/tmp/_s1907_ledger_entry.txt", content: entry});
const r = await tools.pwsh({description: "Append S1907 entry to audit ledger", command: "Add-Content -Path AUDIT_LEDGER.md -Value (Get-Content tmp\\_s1907_ledger_entry.txt -Raw) -Encoding utf8; Select-String -Path AUDIT_LEDGER.md -Pattern '^## S1907' | Select-Object LineNumber,Line"});
console.log(r.stdout.text.slice(0,1000));
console.log(r.stderr.text.slice(0,500));
", "description": "Append S1907 result to AUDIT_LEDGER"}

